
dock load
  load <node:fs>, name fs

form writer
  link dock, mark private
  link path, like text

task create
  mark async
  take path, like text
  take append, like bool, fall wave false

  save flags
    fork test, name append
      hook true, text <a>
      hook false, text <w>

  save handle
    call fs/create-write-stream
      read path
      make options
        bind flags, read flags

  send back
    make writer
      bind dock, read handle
      bind path, read path

task write
  mark async
  take stream, like writer
  take data, like text

  call stream/dock/write
    mark async
    read data

task close
  mark async
  take stream, like writer

  call stream/dock/end
    mark async
